  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation Program for the National Road Safety Policy in the Dominican Republic</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Implementaci&#xF3;n de la Pol&#xED;tica Nacional de Seguridad Vial en la Rep&#xFA;blica Dominicana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es contribuir a una movilidad segura en RD, a trav&#xE9;s de mejores est&#xE1;ndares de la infraestructura vial y la implementaci&#xF3;n de medidas regulatorias prioritarias. Los objetivos espec&#xED;ficos son: (i) mejorar la seguridad de la red vial principal del pa&#xED;s; (ii) mejorar la seguridad en los entornos escolares; y (iii) fortalecer la regulaci&#xF3;n y fiscalizaci&#xF3;n del transporte</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program is to contribute to safe mobility in the Dominican Republic through improved road infrastructure standards and the implementation of priority regulatory measures. The specific objectives are: (i) to improve the safety of the country&apos;s main road network; (ii) to enhance safety in school environments; and (iii) to strengthen transportation regulation and oversight.</narrative>
  </description>
